{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43242","headline":"日暖万年枝 · 王约","name":"日暖万年枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霭霭彤庭里，沈沈玉砌陲。\n初升九华日，潜暖万年枝。\n煦妪光偏好，青葱色转宜。\n每因韶景丽，长沐惠风吹。\n隐映当龙阙，氛氲隔凤池。\n朝阳光照处，唯有近臣知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王约","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}